          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/6Z7ebUFnbizjQkR3b40i13qGuawcRPcqcTMQ18HMyvGz2wQOYmRahWHky67sbzL867rHqjmlaA=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "​@Christine-q6k5k...No one said otherwise...I referred to where I am...and where I have been...and friendship is never just based on speaking the same language...a lot of other interests plays a role...but I just mention \"language barrier\" hoping the one that can read between the \"blur lines\" of that will get it...🤷🏾‍♀",
